{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLHorizontalTurnV10trillSoundAA08MXLTrillF0Vvp","title":"trillSound","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trillSound"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLTrillSoundV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLTrillSound"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The trill-sound attribute group includes attributes used to guide the sound of trills, mordents, turns,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shakes, and wavy lines. The default choices are:"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHorizontalTurn"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlhorizontalturn\/trillsound"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHorizontalTurn\/trillSound"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trillSound"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLTrillSoundV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTrillSound","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLTrillSound"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start-Note = “upper” trill-step = “whole” two-note-turn = “none” accelerate = “no” beats = “4”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Second-beat and last-beat are percentages for landing on the indicated beat, with defaults of 25 and 75"},{"type":"text","text